{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"listen"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLListenV","text":"MXLListen"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"listen","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV6listenAA9MXLListenVSgvp","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/listen"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"listen"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLListen","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLListenV","text":"MXLListen"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to a nested MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<listen>"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/listen","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Listening information associated with this note, if any."}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLListen":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLListen","title":"MXLListen","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLListen"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLListen","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllisten","abstract":[{"text":"The listen and listening types, new in Version 4.0, specify different ways that a score following or machine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"listening application can interact with a performer. The listen type handles interactions that are specific to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a note. If multiple child elements of the same type are present, they should have distinct player and\/or time-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only attributes.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Notes are the most common type of MusicXML data. The MusicXML format distinguishes between elements used for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sound information and elements used for notation information (e.g., tie is used for sound, tied for notation).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus grace notes do not have a duration element. Cue notes have a duration element, as do forward elements,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but no tie elements. Having these two types of information available can make interchange easier, as some","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"programs handle one type of information more readily than the other.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLNote","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/listen":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/listen","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/listen","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"listen"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLListenV","text":"MXLListen"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"listen","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Listening information associated with this note, if any."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}